{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37746","headline":"寄赠孙路处士 · 郑谷","name":"寄赠孙路处士","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"平生诗誉更谁过，归老东吴命若何。\n知己凋零垂白发，故园寥落近沧波。\n酒醒藓砌花阴转，病起渔舟鹭迹多。\n深入富春人不见，闲门空掩半庭莎。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑谷","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37746.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37746","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}